---
title: "Mechanica — every OpenAI call, and the guardrail that catches it"
---
flowchart LR

%% ---------------- legend ----------------
LG1["ORANGE = an OpenAI API call<br/>all of them through app/llm.py"]:::ai
LG2["GREY = our deterministic backend<br/>no model, no tokens"]:::det
LG3["GREEN = the guardrail that<br/>verifies what the model said"]:::guard
LG4["BLACK = what the mechanic<br/>actually gets"]:::ship
LG1 ~~~ LG2 ~~~ LG3 ~~~ LG4

%% ================= 1. IDENTIFY =================
S1["PHOTO of the bike"]:::ui
S2["VIN"]:::ui
D0["400 catalog names —<br/>half cars, half bikes —<br/>injected into the prompt"]:::det
A1["<b>identify.photo</b> · VISION<br/>gpt-5.6-luna · strict json_schema<br/>make · model · generation · kind<br/>cues · alternatives<br/><b>$0.00046 per photo</b>"]:::ai
G1["match back to a real catalog row,<br/>floor 0.80 · kind-locked<br/><b>a bike we hold no manual for<br/>cannot win</b>"]:::guard
D1["NHTSA vPIC decode<br/><b>zero LLM</b>"]:::det
R1["THE EXACT BIKE"]:::ship

S1 --> D0 --> A1 --> G1 --> R1
S2 --> D1 --> R1

%% ================= 2. INGEST, ONCE =================
S3["A BIKE NOBODY<br/>HAS ASKED FOR YET"]:::ui
D2["OEM PDF from the registry<br/>PyMuPDF text layer<br/>+ per-block coordinates<br/><b>zero LLM</b>"]:::det
A2["<b>ingest.struct</b><br/>gpt-5.6-luna · strict json_schema<br/>5-page windows · 32 parallel workers<br/>units · specs · parts · verbatim quotes<br/><b>47% of 70.4M input tokens<br/>served from the prompt cache</b>"]:::ai
A3["<b>ingest.keywords</b><br/>gpt-5.6-luna · strict json_schema<br/>the slang a rider would actually say<br/>for every printed heading"]:::ai
G2["<b>ground.py</b> — every quote is searched<br/>for in the PDF text layer.<br/><b>Not found = DROPPED.</b><br/>A marker can only sit on ink<br/>the manufacturer printed."]:::guard
R2["A SEARCHABLE MANUAL<br/>readable in 7 s · indexed in 50 s<br/><b>$0.10, once, forever</b>"]:::ship

S3 --> D2 --> A2 --> G2 --> R2
D2 --> A3 --> R2

%% ================= 3. QUESTION TO PRINTED PAGE =================
S4["ONE SENTENCE<br/>typed or spoken:<br/>chain is baggy"]:::ui
A4["<b>ask.router</b><br/>gpt-5.6-luna · strict json_schema<br/>intent · components · queries · specName<br/>slang, typos, DE/ES/FR to manual English<br/><b>99.5% prompt-cache hit<br/>on 3.45M tokens · $0.00013</b>"]:::ai
D4["<b>SPEC PATH — ZERO LLM</b><br/>parsed spec rows, each checked<br/>verbatim against its page<br/><b>$0.00013 · 1.5 s · no second call</b>"]:::det
D3["BM25 over the manual's own<br/>printed headings · 6 candidates<br/><b>zero LLM</b>"]:::det
A5["<b>ask.picker</b><br/>gpt-5.6-terra · strict json_schema<br/><b>RETURNS PAGE IDs ONLY —<br/>never a word of prose</b><br/>35% cached · $0.0022"]:::ai
G3["id allowlist: an id that was not in<br/>the candidate list is dropped<br/>before the response is built.<br/><b>A hallucinated section<br/>never reaches the screen.</b>"]:::guard
R3["THE OEM PAGE, LINES MARKED<br/>3D model explodes on the part<br/>top-1 100% of 150 queries<br/><b>p95 3.33 s · $0.00038</b>"]:::ship

S4 --> A4
A4 -- "intent = spec" --> D4 --> R3
A4 -- "else" --> D3
D3 -- "top-2 margin decisive:<br/>skip the model entirely" --> R3
D3 -- "ambiguous" --> A5 --> G3 --> R3

%% ================= 4. GROUNDED CHAT =================
D5["the printed text behind those<br/>sections · at most 6 pages<br/>dealer boilerplate stripped<br/>one bear-2 compression call, -31%"]:::det
A6["<b>chat.answer</b><br/>gpt-5.6-terra · <b>RESPONSES API STREAMING</b><br/>prompt_cache_key pinned per route+model<br/>the model may only emit [p. N]<br/><b>43% cached · first token p50 2.6 s</b>"]:::ai
G4["the MODEL names a page,<br/>the SERVER slices the quote out of<br/>the ORIGINAL page text.<br/><b>Verbatim by construction —<br/>100% of 43 citations.</b>"]:::guard
G5["every digit in the answer must be<br/>printed on a page it was given<br/>(step numbers and [p. N] excluded)<br/><b>0 invented numbers in 25 answers</b>"]:::guard
R4["AN ANSWER WHERE EVERY SENTENCE<br/>CARRIES A [p. N] CHIP<br/>that jumps to that page"]:::ship

D3 --> D5 --> A6 --> G4 --> G5 --> R4

%% ================= 5. EXACT-FIT PARTS =================
S5["TAPS A PART"]:::ui
D6["query built from what the manual<br/>PRINTED for THIS bike: the OEM number,<br/>else the printed spec, + make/model/year<br/><b>zero LLM</b>"]:::det
A7["<b>offers</b> · gpt-5.6-terra<br/><b>BUILT-IN web_search TOOL</b><br/>search_context_size low · max_tool_calls 2<br/>one pipe-delimited line per offer"]:::ai
G6["a price no regex can find in the model's<br/>own text never reaches the UI;<br/>every URL is HEAD-fetched in parallel,<br/>404/410/5xx dropped; FX done in Python"]:::guard
R5["EXACT-FIT PARTS, LIVE PRICES,<br/>CHEAPEST FIRST<br/>~7 cents cold, free cached"]:::ship

S5 --> D6 --> A7 --> G6 --> R5

%% ================= 6. THE ART, GENERATED =================
S6["BUILD TIME"]:::ui
A8["<b>gpt-image-1</b><br/>97 part illustrations + the shipped logo<br/>one style prompt, one camera, one scale<br/>1024px transparent · <b>$0.042 each</b>"]:::ai
A9["<b>images.score</b> · <b>VISION AS A JUDGE</b><br/>gpt-5.6-luna · strict json_schema rubric<br/>single bike · whole bike · sharpness ·<br/>view angle · is it really the model<br/><b>4,136 calls · $2.04</b>"]:::ai
R6["THE ART IN THE APP<br/>a part set that reads as a set;<br/>a catalog with no bad photo in it"]:::ship

S6 --> A8 --> R6
S6 --> A9 --> R6

%% ================= voice + honesty =================
VO["<b>VOICE</b> — the agent thinks with an OpenAI model through Deepgram,<br/>and may ONLY call our grounded tools: find_procedure · read_page · get_spec · list_parts.<br/>Deepgram calls this API directly, so the manual text never passes through the browser. First audio 0.7-2.0 s."]:::ai
NO["<b>HONEST ABOUT WHAT WE DO NOT USE:</b> no fine-tuning · no Batch API · no Assistants API ·<br/>no embeddings and no vector store in the live path. Retrieval is BM25 over a book we already structured."]:::none
VO ~~~ NO

